# docs/for/customers.md: a link from the hoster opens the customer's own statistics.
title A link or a token from your hoster opens the statistics of your own websites, and nothing else
row  menu:box "Your hosting panel" "a signed link" | page:okbox "Your statistics" "your websites, side by side" | token:box "Or a token" "kept like a password"
arrow menu -> page "one click" go
arrow token -> page "typed in"
note Other customers, the rules and the server's settings are never shown to you.
